{"id": "empty-supportive-housing", "title": "Empty supportive housing: about 778 City-funded homes vacant each month", "seconds": 122.2, "voice": "elevenlabs:OtHu0lbpdNTqJVqaxDtR", "narrator": "Maven", "made": "2026-11-24", "key": "3697b76ebdfa0ebb", "words": 362, "beats": [{"scene": "open", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["amount", "established[1]"], "text": "761.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 1.29, "shot": "b0", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "761", "label": "supportive housing units vacant, 12 November 2026", "sub": "of 9,198"}, "emph": ["761"], "wt": [0.0, 0.26, 0.48]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["amount", "established[1]"], "text": "That’s how many supportive housing homes stood empty on November 12, 2026.", "t0": 1.41, "t1": 6.02, "shot": "b0", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "761", "label": "supportive housing units vacant, 12 November 2026", "sub": "of 9,198"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.35, 0.47, 0.7, 1.14, 1.47, 1.72, 1.95, 2.37, 2.55, 2.95, 3.64, 3.95]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["story[0]", "established[1]"], "text": "Of 9,198 in all.", "t0": 6.34, "t1": 8.58, "shot": "b1", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "housing", "label": "Permanent supportive housing", "kicker": "9,198 site-based units", "sub": "the City’s main answer to chronic homelessness"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.44, 0.89, 1.05, 1.31, 1.81, 1.95]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["story[0]", "established[1]"], "text": "Permanent supportive housing is the City’s main answer to chronic homelessness.", "t0": 8.7, "t1": 12.35, "shot": "b1", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "housing", "label": "Permanent supportive housing", "kicker": "9,198 site-based units", "sub": "the City’s main answer to chronic homelessness"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.45, 0.85, 1.33, 1.5, 1.6, 1.95, 2.19, 2.53, 2.62, 2.92]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[1]", "status"], "text": "These are the homelessness department’s own counts, from its own dashboard.", "t0": 12.47, "t1": 15.66, "shot": "b2", "visual": {"type": "doc", "kicker": "The department’s own dashboard", "text": "Official counts from Homelessness and Supportive Housing.", "mark": "Official counts"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.3, 0.45, 0.58, 1.13, 1.6, 1.77, 2.17, 2.35, 2.48, 2.63]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "share", "ref": ["established[1]", "suspicious[0].what"], "text": "8.3 percent vacant. The department’s own target is 7.", "t0": 15.88, "t1": 19.31, "shot": "b3", "visual": {"type": "share", "pct": 8.3, "label": "vacant, 12 November 2026: the department’s own target is 7%"}, "emph": ["8.3 percent"], "wt": [0.0, 0.22, 0.47, 0.7, 1.05, 1.78, 1.94, 2.41, 2.56, 2.94, 3.05]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "rank", "ref": ["suspicious[0].what"], "text": "Of the 761, 90 were open for referral, and 308 had a move-in under way.", "t0": 19.43, "t1": 24.51, "shot": "b4", "visual": {"type": "rank", "label": "The 761 on 12 November 2026", "rows": [["offline", "363"], ["move-in in progress", "308"], ["available for referral", "90"]]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.23, 0.5, 0.73, 1.32, 1.68, 1.86, 2.14, 2.29, 3.04, 3.23, 3.44, 3.7, 3.96, 4.09, 4.16, 4.53, 4.75]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "rank", "ref": ["suspicious[0].what"], "text": "The other 363 were offline.", "t0": 24.63, "t1": 26.8, "shot": "b4", "visual": {"type": "rank", "label": "The 761 on 12 November 2026", "rows": [["offline", "363"], ["move-in in progress", "308"], ["available for referral", "90"]]}, "emph": ["363"], "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.32, 0.54, 0.82, 1.45, 1.64]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0].what"], "text": "Over twelve months, vacancies averaged 778 a month. Never fewer than 744.", "t0": 26.92, "t1": 33.14, "shot": "b5", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "778", "label": "vacant a month, on average, 2025-12 to 2026-11", "sub": "never below 744"}, "emph": ["778"], "wt": [0.0, 0.22, 0.51, 0.93, 1.52, 2.0, 2.36, 2.72, 3.28, 3.35, 4.17, 4.5, 4.84, 5.02, 5.3, 5.55]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0].why"], "text": "Every empty unit is a home not given to someone on the street.", "t0": 33.56, "t1": 36.1, "shot": "b6", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Every empty unit is a home not given to someone on the street while its building’s costs run on."}, "wt": [0.0, 0.3, 0.64, 0.91, 1.01, 1.08, 1.29, 1.45, 1.69, 1.77, 2.05, 2.13, 2.22]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0].why"], "text": "And its building’s costs run on.", "t0": 36.22, "t1": 37.67, "shot": "b6", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Every empty unit is a home not given to someone on the street while its building’s costs run on."}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.25, 0.6, 1.01, 1.21]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[0].what"], "text": "And a new building, Harbor Haven, had 22 of 67 counted units empty. That’s outside these counts.", "t0": 37.79, "t1": 43.99, "shot": "b7", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "housing", "label": "Harbor Haven", "kicker": "A new building in lease-up", "sub": "22 of 67 counted units empty; outside these counts"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.2, 0.37, 0.77, 1.06, 1.74, 1.89, 2.54, 2.67, 3.26, 3.61, 3.88, 4.89, 5.16, 5.52, 5.72]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "slam", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "links[1]"], "text": "Offline means not available to anyone. Why were they offline?", "t0": 44.21, "t1": 47.99, "shot": "b8", "visual": {"type": "slam", "words": ["Offline"], "sub": "not available to anyone: 363 units"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.48, 0.74, 0.94, 1.36, 1.46, 2.32, 2.54, 2.67, 2.83]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "rank", "ref": ["suspicious[1].what"], "text": "Janitorial maintenance: 77.", "t0": 47.99, "t1": 50.63, "shot": "b9", "visual": {"type": "rank", "label": "Offline, by reason given", "rows": [["janitorial maintenance", "77"], ["property hold", "68"], ["internal transfer", "59"], ["recently vacated", "54"], ["building rehab", "44"]]}, "emph": ["77"], "wt": [0.04, 0.67, 1.44]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "rank", "ref": ["suspicious[1].what"], "text": "Property holds: 68. Internal transfers: 59.", "t0": 50.63, "t1": 55.0, "shot": "b9", "visual": {"type": "rank", "label": "Offline, by reason given", "rows": [["janitorial maintenance", "77"], ["property hold", "68"], ["internal transfer", "59"], ["recently vacated", "54"], ["building rehab", "44"]]}, "wt": [0.04, 0.48, 1.32, 2.5, 2.92, 3.72]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "rank", "ref": ["suspicious[1].what"], "text": "Building rehab and significant damage, 44 each. Coroner holds, 17.", "t0": 55.12, "t1": 59.32, "shot": "b9", "visual": {"type": "rank", "label": "Offline, by reason given", "rows": [["janitorial maintenance", "77"], ["property hold", "68"], ["internal transfer", "59"], ["recently vacated", "54"], ["building rehab", "44"]]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.31, 0.7, 0.81, 1.32, 1.69, 2.14, 2.9, 3.26, 3.63]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1].what", "suspicious[1].why"], "text": "On average, 373 offline every month.", "t0": 59.44, "t1": 62.04, "shot": "b10", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "373", "label": "offline a month, on average", "sub": "414 in 2025-12; never fewer than 329"}, "emph": ["373"], "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.56, 0.79, 1.08, 1.65, 2.06, 2.26]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1].what", "suspicious[1].why"], "text": "A steady count of several hundred is not a passing backlog.", "t0": 62.16, "t1": 64.77, "shot": "b10", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "373", "label": "offline a month, on average", "sub": "414 in 2025-12; never fewer than 329"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.39, 0.64, 0.73, 1.05, 1.37, 1.5, 1.66, 1.71, 2.05]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "form", "ref": ["established[2]", "suspicious[2]"], "text": "What do the offline homes cost? The Budget and Legislative Analyst gives per-unit figures.", "t0": 65.19, "t1": 70.21, "shot": "b11", "visual": {"type": "form", "title": "Budget and Legislative Analyst", "sub": "Files 220133 and 220885", "rows": [["Per-unit operating estimate", "$19,800 a unit a year"], ["A later estimate, one site", "$30,047 a unit a year"]]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.3, 0.44, 0.87, 1.16, 2.07, 2.25, 2.56, 2.69, 3.27, 3.7, 3.97, 4.45]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[2].what"], "text": "At the department’s own estimate, 373 offline units", "t0": 70.33, "t1": 73.89, "shot": "b12", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["at $19,800 a unit a year", "$7,385,400"], "b": ["at $30,047 a unit a year", "$11,207,531"], "arrows": false}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.22, 0.71, 0.9, 1.49, 1.83, 2.16, 2.81, 3.25]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[2].what"], "text": "come to about 7,385,400 dollars a year.", "t0": 73.89, "t1": 76.08, "shot": "b12x", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["at $19,800 a unit a year", "$7,385,400"], "b": ["at $30,047 a unit a year", "$11,207,531"], "arrows": false}, "emph": ["7,385,400"], "wt": [0.04, 0.25, 0.35, 0.6, 0.86, 1.1, 1.28, 1.55, 1.83, 1.91]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[2].what"], "text": "At a higher estimate made later for one site, 11,207,531.", "t0": 76.2, "t1": 80.0, "shot": "b12", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["at $19,800 a unit a year", "$7,385,400"], "b": ["at $30,047 a unit a year", "$11,207,531"], "arrows": false}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.2, 0.49, 0.88, 1.11, 1.42, 1.58, 1.79, 2.42, 2.69, 2.98, 3.21, 3.39]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[2].why", "notEstablished[1]"], "text": "That’s budgeted cost for homes nobody can live in. Not money lost.", "t0": 80.12, "t1": 83.73, "shot": "b13", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "This is budgeted cost for homes nobody can live in, not money lost."}, "wt": [0.0, 0.24, 0.66, 0.97, 1.13, 1.45, 1.76, 1.9, 2.12, 2.69, 2.91, 3.14]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[2].why", "notEstablished[1]"], "text": "Some leases are paid per occupied unit.", "t0": 83.85, "t1": 85.7, "shot": "b13", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "This is budgeted cost for homes nobody can live in, not money lost."}, "wt": [0.0, 0.26, 0.56, 0.67, 0.93, 1.09, 1.58]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["established[0]"], "text": "The department’s own pages don’t agree.", "t0": 85.82, "t1": 87.48, "shot": "b13a", "visual": {"type": "versus", "kicker": "The department’s own pages", "a": ["site-based units, housing inventory", "9,649"], "b": ["site-based units, vacancy dashboard", "9,198"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.59, 0.75, 1.11, 1.31]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["established[0]"], "text": "Its inventory lists 9,649 site-based units:", "t0": 87.6, "t1": 91.66, "shot": "b13ax", "visual": {"type": "versus", "kicker": "The department’s own pages", "a": ["site-based units, housing inventory", "9,649"], "b": ["site-based units, vacancy dashboard", "9,198"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.69, 1.0, 1.28, 1.72, 1.97, 2.28, 2.83, 3.36]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["established[0]"], "text": "451 more than the dashboard.", "t0": 91.66, "t1": 94.01, "shot": "b13ay", "visual": {"type": "versus", "kicker": "The department’s own pages", "a": ["site-based units, housing inventory", "9,649"], "b": ["site-based units, vacancy dashboard", "9,198"]}, "emph": ["451 more"], "wt": [0.04, 0.32, 0.57, 1.08, 1.47, 1.68, 1.78]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["established[0]"], "text": "Its printed scorecard says targets are “under review”; the data behind it sets 90 percent.", "t0": 94.13, "t1": 99.11, "shot": "b13b", "visual": {"type": "quote", "kicker": "The department’s scorecard", "line": "under review"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.43, 0.96, 1.15, 1.52, 1.66, 2.0, 3.07, 3.22, 3.5, 3.81, 3.95, 4.22, 4.51]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "share", "ref": ["established[3]"], "text": "By that 90 percent yardstick, supportive housing was on target from April 2026.", "t0": 99.23, "t1": 103.56, "shot": "b13c", "visual": {"type": "share", "pct": 92, "label": "site-based supportive housing occupied, August and September 2026: the scorecard’s target is 90%"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.34, 0.64, 0.94, 1.46, 1.9, 2.25, 2.4, 2.52, 2.93, 3.13, 3.42, 3.66]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]", "notEstablished[3]"], "text": "The dashboard gives counts on a date.", "t0": 103.78, "t1": 105.28, "shot": "b14", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["How long any unit has been empty", "Which buildings hold the offline units"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.58, 0.79, 1.05, 1.17, 1.24]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]", "notEstablished[3]"], "text": "It doesn’t show how long any unit sat empty, or which buildings hold them.", "t0": 105.4, "t1": 108.44, "shot": "b14", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["How long any unit has been empty", "Which buildings hold the offline units"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.03, 0.24, 0.39, 0.51, 0.73, 0.94, 1.18, 1.42, 1.95, 2.11, 2.31, 2.65, 2.84]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "settle", "ref": ["next[0]", "next[1]"], "text": "What would settle it? The department’s unit-level vacancy report, site by site, and the lease terms.", "t0": 108.56, "t1": 113.91, "shot": "b15", "visual": {"type": "settle", "cards": [{"who": "", "what": "The department’s unit-level vacancy and days-vacant report, by site"}, {"who": "", "what": "The lease and operating terms: paid per unit or per occupied unit"}], "focus": 0}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.33, 0.65, 1.27, 1.45, 1.98, 2.48, 2.95, 3.52, 3.8, 3.96, 4.33, 4.47, 4.58, 4.81]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "status", "ref": ["status", "defense[0]"], "text": "Some vacancy is unavoidable. No authority has found waste, and no operator is accused.", "t0": 114.03, "t1": 119.01, "shot": "b16", "visual": {"type": "status"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.31, 0.74, 0.87, 2.18, 2.43, 2.82, 2.94, 3.17, 3.54, 3.72, 3.91, 4.35, 4.44]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "end", "ref": ["end"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 119.13, "t1": 121.28, "shot": "b17", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.31, 0.65, 0.8, 1.06, 1.17, 1.26, 1.5, 1.76]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"open": "761", "lead1": "Above its own target", "lead2": "Offline", "lead3": "A yardstick", "close": "Where it stands"}, "look": "newsroom", "hook": "number"}